# Ingestion worker runtime dependencies (Day 1).
# The worker reuses api/app/services/ingestion.py, so it needs the same data and
# provider libraries as the API, minus the HTTP server stack (fastapi/uvicorn).
# Versions are kept identical to api/requirements.in on purpose: a version skew
# between API and worker would change the pipeline identity across services.
